From 2cb1c3412817dc46a99050c4f25f54de8b0690f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "erik.hauan" <erik.hauan@radiantvs.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:26:24 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] ui-broker: relay slot capacity and jit_load behind S6

Behaviour: a directory node's slotsByEngine and jitLoadByEngine reach
EnrichedNode and the client-facing AvailableNode under their wire keys;
modelsObservedAt (scanner-only) is not relayed, as before.

Seams used: S6 (broker.go: AvailableNode embeds LocalBrokerExt;
discovery.go: EnrichedNode embeds LocalBrokerExt, and the directoryToEnriched
and toAvailable literals set it, each after NVIDIA's new DownloadedByEngine
and marked // fork:S6; type and projection in
services/nvpair-ui-broker/local_ext.go). TestDirectoryRelaysSlotCapacity
moves from discovery_test.go to local_s6_test.go, so discovery_test.go is
NVIDIA verbatim.

Proving tests: TestS6_Nil, TestDirectoryRelaysSlotCapacity,
TestLocalBrokerRelayJSONKeys (nvpair-ui-broker).

Feature-group commit for catch-up step 4, exported as
local/patches/006-broker-slot-relay.patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
